# The build context is this directory, and the image only needs go.mod,
# go.sum and the sources. Everything below would otherwise be uploaded to the
# daemon on every build for nothing.

# Locally-built binary — 16 MB, and the image compiles its own anyway. Named
# exactly `registry` because that is what `go build` in this directory emits;
# the pattern is anchored so it cannot match the directory itself elsewhere.
/registry

# The catalogue. This is real data, and a public image must never carry it.
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
*.db

# Deploy credentials for ./deploy-registry
.ghcr-token

# Tests are run by CI and by hand, not inside the image build.
*_test.go
testdata/

# Not needed to build. LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES are deliberately NOT
# excluded — the image is required to carry them, and a dropped notice is a
# licence violation rather than a missing nicety.
*.md
.git
.DS_Store
